WEBVTT

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.810
So you're really leaving?

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.990
I'm leaving these sketches with you.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.570
The Impossible House?

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.280
Yeah.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.160
I leave it to you now.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.910
I only said I was going to help.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.000
I want you to finish it for me.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.710
Are you all right?

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:30.960
What about you?

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:32.880
I love you.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.090
Yujin...

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:38.800
I'm not going to forget anything.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.810
I'll remember all the moments we've shared together.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.690
Don't see me off at the airport tomorrow.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.440
I won't.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.570
And Yujin, let's...

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.580
never meet again.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:05.500
Let's just cherish the time we spent at the ocean as our last

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.330
and never meet again, savoring only those good times we had.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.720
<i>We are experiencing some turbulence;</i>

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:51.810
<i>please return to your seat and fasten your seat belt.</i>

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:24.930
<i>Joonsang.</i>

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:30.480
<i>Was seeing you just a dream?</i>

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.120
Manhattan Hospital, please.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:08.390
<i>I still remember so much.</i>

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:12.180
<i>I remember the sound of the piano you played for me,</i>

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.950
<i>the lakeside sunset that we walked in together,</i>

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:32.620
<i>and the smile that came to my face when you held my hand;</i>

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.000
<i>I still remember them all.</i>

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.960
<i>I always prayed</i>

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.760
<i>that one day I might,</i>

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:45.300
<i>once again, be able to see your smile</i>

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:49.390
<i>that lives in my memories.</i>

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.350
<i>Did the first snow grant me my wish?</i>

00:04:55.770 --> 00:05:00.900
<i>Or was it just me dreaming amidst the first snow that day?</i>

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:04.320
<i>Joonsang,</i>

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.740
<i>where are you now?</i>

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.950
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:16.920
We're here.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:19.880
Mister?

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:30.100
Sorry, could we stop by some other place first?

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:37.810
Thanks for coming.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:50.200
<i>A loving heart is the best home that two loving people could have.</i>

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:19.940
<i>Yujin,</i>

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:21.940
<i>let's never meet again.</i>

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.530
<i>Let's just cherish the time we spent at the ocean as our last,</i>

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:32.910
<i>and never meet again, savoring only</i>

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.950
<i>those good times we had.</i>

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.080
<i>Can you do that for me?</i>

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:17.580
<i>You're really good at piano!</i>

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.210
<i>What's this song called?</i>

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:21.790
<i>"The First Time".</i>

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.370
Do I know you?

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:06.540
<i>"The First Time"?</i>

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:11.510
<i>That was the first time I ditched class.</i>

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.050
<i>It was the first time I climbed over a fence on a guy's back,</i>

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:16.760
<i>and held hands with a guy.</i>

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:21.770
<i>It was also the first time I ever hopped on a bike with a guy.</i>

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.310
<i>Me too.</i>

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.720
You have no idea how much that patient scared me!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.100
Emergency patient coming through; out of the way!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:49.690
Coming through!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.070
Come on, hurry!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:54.150
Minhyung?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.820
Is that you, Minhyung?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.110
Can you hear my voice?

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:00.620
It's me, Jane.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.260
Wake up, Minhyung.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.850
You're going to sleep right through it if you don't.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.100
Don't worry, Jane.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.350
I've never missed it yet, have I?

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.740
It's almost time.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.370
I'll fill it up, just like you asked.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.540
Now, Minhyung!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:57.510
It's like I've told you many times; it's true.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.600
Once the Angel of Bethesda descends upon a pool,

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:02.390
the pool itself trembles from the flapping of his wings;

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.250
and if you dip your body into the pool when that happens,

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:07.270
you're supposed to be cured instantly of any disease!

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.570
I hope this will help my brother, Harry, recover.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:16.400
Of course it will.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:17.940
He'll get better before you know it.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.860
Let's all solve puzzles again together when Harry gets better.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.070
Like when we first met?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:27.790
Oh yeah, were you able to remember who it is?

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:34.540
When we first met you looked at me and called out someone's name.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.300
It was like "Yujin" or something.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.550
Did I really?

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:42.470
You forgot again, didn't you?

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.200
Maybe.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.800
She must not be that important if I forgot her.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.390
So, you're just going to forget me like you did her, aren't you?

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:49.250
Of course not;

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.730
how could I forget a pretty princess like you?

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.270
Hey, Joonsang!

00:11:58.270 --> 00:11:59.110
What's wrong?

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:03.530
Joonsang...

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.600
Minhyung?

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.580
Minhyung?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.500
Please make the necessary arrangements;

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.340
he needs to go into surgery as soon as he's stabilized.

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:20.840
Yes, Doctor.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:29.600
You're awake?

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.280
Do you remember me?

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:46.030
How could I forget a pretty princess like you?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.740
Long time no see, Jane.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.910
Where have you been for the last ten days?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.090
Your mother and Professor Ahn were looking all over for you.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.130
My mother?

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.970
I thought I asked them

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:06.470
not to tell my mother about my condition or the surgery...

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.600
Professor Ahn told me about it,

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:13.140
but your mother was the one who came to us about your condition first.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.920
We couldn't get a hold of you,

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:17.660
nor did we have any way of knowing how to find you;

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.650
we had no choice but to tell the truth.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:26.910
I have a favor to ask you.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.080
The patient refuses to see you.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.750
What are you saying?

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.840
Our first priority is to get him stabilized;

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:47.180
as his doctor, I have no choice but to respect his wishes.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.700
I'm his mother.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.430
You have no right to stop me from seeing my son.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.720
We'll have to expel you from the hospital, if you insist on seeing him.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:56.770
Wait.

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.350
Let me talk to him first.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:07.490
Could I have a word with you?

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.200
Is there any way I could get a hold of her?

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.960
I heard she canceled her concert at the last minute.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.620
Is it because of her son?

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.000
Did something happen to him?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.130
Y-Yes.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.050
I see.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:30.720
This is Jinwoo Kim.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.050
I'll be waiting for your call.

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:43.480
Are these accurate?

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.990
Is this really true?

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.820
Are you all right?

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.290
I'm sorry.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:00.000
I should have realized it right away.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.420
I should have realized who you were right away.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:06.250
I'm really sorry, Joonsang.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:18.020
<i>Please keep it a secret from both my mother and Yujin.</i>

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:21.270
<i>Swear to me that you won't tell.</i>

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:22.560
<i>Please.</i>

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.940
The damage to your optic nerves is worse than we thought.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:33.280
You need surgery as soon as possible.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.990
Will I get better if I get the surgery?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.870
There's no way of telling how much the hematoma has spread,

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:42.790
or what state it's in now.

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:47.630
There's something I need to do while I still have my vision.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.400
I don't care how you do it.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.630
As long as...

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.310
As long as I can hold on until <i>then.</i>

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:02.510
Does that "something" have something to do with your decision

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:04.520
not to see Mi Hee?

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.200
What did he say?

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.750
Most importantly, he doesn't want to go into surgery right away.

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:24.750
Did you know about this too?

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.840
I only told him that in his current condition

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:32.340
it's unlikely that he'll fully recover his vision through surgery alone.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:34.800
Joonsang!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:36.550
Joonsang!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.100
Let's get you into surgery right now!

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.190
You can get better—

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.720
No, you <i>will</i> get better if you do.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.350
Why did you lie to me?

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.480
Why did you say that my father passed away?

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.950
Why did you make me think that Yujin and I share the same father?

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.990
What are you talking about?

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.090
I'm sorry, Joonsang.

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.420
You're "sorry"?

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:22.060
How could you say that after all that's happened?

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:26.100
You've bruised both mine and Yujin's hearts

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.560
and turned us both into complete shambles,

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:30.650
and "sorry" is all you can say?

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:34.860
I really wanted to think of you as Hyeonsoo's son;

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.900
no, I really did think of you as his son.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.740
That was the only way I could live with myself.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:45.080
That was the only way I could force myself to not abandon you.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:47.580
Joonsang...

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.920
Does Jinwoo know?

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:00.180
He told me about your condition.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:07.560
He apparently found out from the doctors right after you left Korea.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:13.440
If it weren't for him, I'd never have found out that you were sick.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.570
I owe my thanks to him as well.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.990
If he hadn't requested a DNA test,

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:25.240
I would still believe your lie.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:43.180
<i>When something's "impossible" it means it can't be done.</i>

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.770
<i>So I told myself over and over that I should let it go</i>

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.480
<i>and not hold on to it.</i>

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:53.260
<i>I'm half-way across the world from Korea,</i>

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:55.570
<i>but my heart still</i>

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:59.490
<i>seems to be exactly where it was.</i>

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.600
<i>Just like it was ten years ago,</i>

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.620
<i>when I thought that you were dead.</i>

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:10.580
<i>Just like the period when I kept lying to myself,</i>

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.670
<i>telling myself that Minhyung and you were different people.</i>

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:19.010
<i>Sanghyuk might have been right when he said</i>

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:23.140
<i>that it takes time for true sadness</i>

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.350
<i>to settle into your heart.</i>

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.770
<i>I wonder how much time I'm going to need</i>

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:33.350
<i>until that sadness fades away from my heart?</i>

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:45.700
Remember this?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.750
I said I'd hold on to it until you remembered, right?

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:11.850
It's cold; put this on.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.540
Whose is it?

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.360
Pink definitely isn't your color, Minhyung.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.400
I think I borrowed it from someone, but I don't remember who.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.070
The nurse, maybe?

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.250
Maybe.

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:26.700
I don't remember, though.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:28.830
Why do you only have one?

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.500
You forgot again, didn't you?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:35.320
Okay.

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:37.420
I'll hold on to it until you remember.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.380
Gee, thanks.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:48.430
See that star over there?

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:50.870
That one?

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:53.060
You mean the one that's shining the brightest?

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.260
It's so pretty how it shines.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:56.790
It has a pretty name too;

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.520
it's called Polaris.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:00.230
Polaris?

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.530
Back in the old days,

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.570
people used to use Polaris as their compass when they were lost.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:09.330
But don't the stars change positions with the seasons?

00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:12.830
Polaris always keeps its place, regardless of the season.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.750
I see.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.670
I didn't know you knew so much about the stars.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.090
I actually don't;

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:21.710
it just came to me.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:22.920
Polaris...

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.470
Did you figure out who its owner is?

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:32.460
Yeah.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:37.140
What in the world's been going on with you?

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:39.900
They're all calling you "Joonsang,"

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:42.000
you're refusing to get the surgery,

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.570
and then there was that thing about your father just now.

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:46.400
So you heard.

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:48.950
It's a long story.

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:52.410
I guess it has been ten years.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.250
This last winter felt longer to me

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.330
than the last ten years, actually.

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:00.960
Want to tell me about it?

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:02.630
It's a really long story.

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:04.230
I don't mind.

00:22:04.230 --> 00:22:05.300
They say a New York night is longer than the rest, after all.

00:22:07.210 --> 00:22:08.510
I was lost.

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:12.060
Even though Polaris always kept its place,

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:13.850
I couldn't keep my own.

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:18.440
I was too weak and foolish,

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:22.190
so I was lost again.

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:29.030
Hello?

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:31.030
Hello?

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:36.910
Mi Hee?

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:38.250
It's you, isn't it?

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:43.130
<i>Manager Kim told me that you called quite a few times.</i>

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:44.260
How is Joonsang?

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:46.050
Is he all right?

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:46.990
He's fine, isn't he?

00:22:46.990 --> 00:22:47.880
What about the surgery?

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:53.100
<i>I appreciate your concern, but you can't call me like this.</i>

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:57.140
Is he really okay?

00:22:57.560 --> 00:22:58.810
Joonsang is fine,

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:00.560
so don't ever call me again.

00:23:00.730 --> 00:23:03.770
<i>Is it true that Joonsang is our son?</i>

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:05.780
<i>Is it?</i>

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>Is it?</i>

00:23:09.860 --> 00:23:12.450
No, Joonsang is <i>my</i> son.

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:13.570
He's <i>my</i> only son.

00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:22.210
H-Honey...

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:27.340
How could you?!

00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:29.590
How could you cheat on me?!

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:33.760
Honey!

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:37.440
Honey!

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:38.390
Honey!

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:40.270
Get a hold of yourself!
